---
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>St George, Bank SA &amp; Bank of Melbourne — Recovery Hub · Kara</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-white text-neutral-900 antialiased">

    <!-- NAV -->
    <nav class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 pt-10 pb-4">
      <a href="/work" class="text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors">
        ← Back
      </a>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <header class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 pt-16 pb-20">
      <h1 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[64px] leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-black mb-10" style="max-width: 1080px;">
        St George, Bank SA &amp; Bank of Melbourne —<br />
        <em class="italic">Recovery Hub</em>
      </h1>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-16 gap-y-4 text-neutral-900">
        <div>
          <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-1">Case Study</span>
          <span class="block text-sm text-neutral-900">2019</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-1">Role</span>
          <span class="block text-sm text-neutral-900">Visual Designer (UX/UI)</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-1">Brands</span>
          <span class="block text-sm text-neutral-900">St George, Bank SA, Bank of Melbourne</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-1">Tools</span>
          <span class="block text-sm text-neutral-900">Miro, Photoshop, Sketch, InVision, Jira</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO IMAGE — full bleed -->
    <figure class="w-full mb-20">
      <img
        src="/case-studies/recovery-hub/recovery-hub-st-george.jpg"
        alt="St George Recovery Hub final design"
        class="w-full h-auto"
      />
    </figure>

    <!-- OUTCOME -->
    <section class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 mb-20">
      <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">Outcome</h2>
      <p class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px] mb-0">Designed the flow and page layouts for a new Recovery Hub section across the St George, Bank of Melbourne, and BankSA websites, using each brand's design system — giving customers affected by the 2019/2020 bushfires, and later the COVID-19 pandemic, an easy way to find financial assistance resources and tools. Customer validation and analytics confirmed people were finding and navigating to the pages they needed, and the hub was later rolled out to Westpac as well.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- THE DILEMMA -->
    <div class="w-full mb-20" style="background: #F3F0EC; padding: 80px 0;">
      <div class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8">
        <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">The brief</h2>
        <div class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px]">
          <p class="mb-0">After the 2019/2020 bushfires, Bank of Melbourne, St George, and BankSA identified a need for customers to easily access financial resources and tools to help them get back on their feet. That need only grew with the COVID-19 pandemic.</p>
          <p>The brief was to design the flow and page layouts for this new section, using the St George, Bank of Melbourne, and BankSA design systems.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PROCESS -->
    <section class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 mb-20">
      <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">Process</h2>
      <div class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px]">
        <p class="mb-0">Collaborating with Digital Production and UX, we identified where the most suitable place for this section to live would be. I created low-fidelity wireframes and workshopped these with Marketing, the Davidson Institute, and other Product Owners. Once the initial layouts and IA were approved, I worked with Content and Brand to source imagery and create assets, which were then sent to Digital Production once signed off.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WIREFRAME & USER FLOW -->
    <div class="w-full mb-20" style="background: #F3F0EC; padding: 80px 0;">
      <div class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 flex flex-col gap-16">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase leading-[44px] mb-4">Wireframe</p>
          <img
            src="/case-studies/recovery-hub/recovery-hub-wireframe.png"
            alt="Recovery Hub low-fidelity wireframe showing the Support, Self Service, Online Services, and Product Help sections"
            class="w-full h-auto shadow-md"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase leading-[44px] mb-4">User flow</p>
          <img
            src="/case-studies/recovery-hub/recovery-hub-user-flow.png"
            alt="Recovery Hub information architecture and user flow diagram"
            class="w-full h-auto shadow-md"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FINAL DESIGNS — multibrand rollout -->
    <section class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 mb-20">
      <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">Final designs</h2>
      <p class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px] mb-12">Built on a multibrand design system, so the default design was built for St George first, then rolled out to Bank of Melbourne and BankSA.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-16">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[36px] text-black mb-4">
            <a href="https://www.stgeorge.com.au/help/support/recovery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors">St George →</a>
          </h3>
          <img
            src="/case-studies/recovery-hub/recovery-hub-st-george.jpg"
            alt="St George Recovery Hub final design"
            class="w-full h-auto shadow-md"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[36px] text-black mb-4">
            <a href="https://www.bankofmelbourne.com.au/help/support/recovery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors">Bank of Melbourne →</a>
          </h3>
          <img
            src="/case-studies/recovery-hub/recovery-hub-bank-of-melbourne.jpg"
            alt="Bank of Melbourne Recovery Hub final design"
            class="w-full h-auto shadow-md"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[36px] text-black mb-4">
            <a href="https://www.banksa.com.au/help/support/recovery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors">BankSA →</a>
          </h3>
          <img
            src="/case-studies/recovery-hub/recovery-hub-banksa.jpg"
            alt="BankSA Recovery Hub final design"
            class="w-full h-auto shadow-md"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- RESULT -->
    <section class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 mb-20">
      <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">Result</h2>
      <div class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px]">
        <p class="mb-0">A new section on all three websites that customers looking for financial assistance can find easily — validated directly with customers. Analytics showed people were navigating to their desired pages. A few months later, the Recovery Hub was rolled out to Westpac too.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 py-24 border-t border-neutral-200">
      <a href="/work" class="text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors">
        ← Back to all work
      </a>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>
